---
import DocsLayout from "@/layouts/DocsLayout.astro";
import { text, fontWeight, lineHeight, fontFamily } from "@horon-ai/tokens";

const scale = Object.entries(text);
const weights = Object.entries(fontWeight);
const leading = Object.entries(lineHeight);
const families = Object.entries(fontFamily.web);
---

<DocsLayout
  title="Typography"
  eyebrow="Foundations"
  section="foundations"
  description="본문은 Geist Variable 하나로 씁니다. 크기는 캡션 12px부터 히어로 48px까지 7단이고, 무게와 줄 간격은 별도 스케일로 조합합니다."
>
  <p>
    타입 스케일은 두 겹입니다. 컴포넌트가 넓게 쓰는 Tailwind 정렬 스케일(<code>fontSize</code>)과,
    캔버스의 의미 단위 스케일(<code>text</code>)입니다. 문서와 마케팅 화면은 의미 단위를 씁니다.
  </p>

  <h2>의미 단위 스케일</h2>
  <div class="not-prose mt-5 divide-y divide-border border-y border-border">
    {
      scale.map(([name, size]) => (
        <div class="flex items-baseline gap-6 py-4">
          <span class="w-24 shrink-0 font-mono text-[11px] text-muted-foreground">{name}</span>
          <span class="w-14 shrink-0 font-mono text-[11px] text-muted-foreground">{size}px</span>
          <span class="min-w-0 truncate font-semibold tracking-[-0.02em]" style={`font-size:${size}px`}>
            See. Build. Execute.
          </span>
        </div>
      ))
    }
  </div>

  <h2>무게</h2>
  <div class="not-prose mt-5 grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2">
    {
      weights.map(([name, value]) => (
        <div class="rounded-sm border border-border px-4 py-3">
          <p class="font-mono text-[10.5px] text-muted-foreground">
            {name} · {value}
          </p>
          <p class="mt-1 text-[1.125rem] tracking-[-0.01em]" style={`font-weight:${value}`}>
            Insight, activated.
          </p>
        </div>
      ))
    }
  </div>

  <h2>줄 간격</h2>
  <div class="not-prose mt-5 overflow-hidden rounded-md border border-border">
    <table class="w-full text-left text-[12.5px]">
      <thead class="border-b border-border bg-muted/50 text-muted-foreground">
        <tr>
          <th class="px-4 py-2 font-medium">token</th>
          <th class="px-4 py-2 font-medium">value</th>
          <th class="px-4 py-2 font-medium">쓰는 곳</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        {
          leading.map(([name, value]) => (
            <tr class="border-b border-border last:border-b-0">
              <td class="px-4 py-2 font-mono">{name}</td>
              <td class="px-4 py-2 font-mono text-muted-foreground">{value}</td>
              <td class="px-4 py-2 text-muted-foreground">
                {name === "tight" || name === "snug"
                  ? "제목, 큰 수치"
                  : name === "normal"
                    ? "본문"
                    : "설명 문단, 긴 글"}
              </td>
            </tr>
          ))
        }
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

  <h2>폰트 패밀리</h2>
  <ul>
    {
      families.map(([name, stack]) => (
        <li>
          <code>{name}</code> — {stack}
        </li>
      ))
    }
  </ul>
  <p>
    네이티브는 CSS 스택 문자열을 해석하지 못하므로 <code>@horon-ai/tokens/native</code>가 단일 패밀리
    이름(<code>Geist</code>)을 따로 냅니다.
  </p>
</DocsLayout>
